<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>웹 기술의 이해 - 디자인앤테크놀러지</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #1a1a1a;
            --accent-color: #3b82f6;
            --card-bg: #f3f4f6;
            --border-color: #e5e7eb;
        }

        [data-theme='dark'] {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --text-color: #f1f5f9;
            --accent-color: #60a5fa;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --border-color: #334155;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .home-btn {
            position: fixed;
            top: 1.5rem;
            left: 1.5rem;
            z-index: 50;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 0.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .theme-toggle {
            position: fixed;
            top: 1.5rem;
            right: 1.5rem;
            z-index: 50;
            padding: 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.25rem;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .section-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
        }

        .content-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .gradient-heading {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #8b5cf6);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .nav-dots {
            position: fixed;
            right: 1.5rem;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
            z-index: 40;
        }

        .nav-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: var(--border-color);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .nav-dot.active {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .tag {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 0.25rem;
            background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent-color);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="https://elimis03.github.io/AI2026-202366243/" class="home-btn">HOME</a>
    
    <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" aria-label="테마 전환">
